peaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "text": "Of all 20th century inventions, the one that perhaps people have been influenced by the most is the television. Living rooms are being taken over by 72-inch screens for better viewing even before they are furnished. Newer, better models to enhance our viewing pleasure are being advertised every day. We have been turned into voyeurs. Many of us watch life happen rather than participating in it.", "id": 1}, {"time": "26300", "image": "", "text": "Since the first 5-inch black and white television sets arrived in the early 1940s, people have been fascinated by what's on it. In the early 50s, TV experienced an explosive growth - from 6,000 to 12 million sets! Today more sets are being bought and installed than ever. North Americans have bought an average of 3 per household.\u201cThe Golden Age of Television\" drew its headliners from Hollywood movies. Since then it has created it's own. The public's appetite for TV has grown over the years. The shows themselves have changed.", "id": 2}, {"time": "64000", "image": "", "text": "The constantly happy household featured in the 50s and 60s has given way to more realistic or quirkier renditions of the same. Reality shows have replaced the game shows of yesteryear. The simple police drama has morphed into ones featuring forensic scientists. The TV set has certainly been updated since the days of the small box with one channel. Whether the programs on it are still worth being watched is another matter altogether. Ultimately, that is a choice each of us has to make for ourselves.", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le17ob03re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The World of Entertainment"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Brief History of Television"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Passive of Present Continuous and Present Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use an active structure when you want the \"doer\"  of the action to be the subject.<br/> You use a passive structure when you want the \"receiver\" of the action to be the subject. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "  You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> to talk  about an action that is happening at the time of speaking.  The action or event is in progress. <br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">Companies <span class=\"strong\">are advertising</span>  newer, better models to enhance our viewing pleasure every day. </span> <br/><br/> You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect </span> to talk about a finished action or event with present consequences. There is a connection between what happened in the past and the present. <br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Televisions  <span class=\"strong\">have turned</span> us into voyeurs.</span> <br/><br/> You often choose the <span class=\"strong\">passive form</span> when you want to  talk about an action but are not so interested in saying who or  what does/did it. Passives without <span class=\"italic\">agents</span> (the doers) are common in writing.  <br/><br/> Look at the chart below for the structure of the passive voice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am/are/is +  being + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Newer, better models to enhance our viewing pleasure are being advertised every day.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have/has + been + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">We have been turned into voyeurs.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Of all 20th century inventions, the one that perhaps people have been influenced by the most is television. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Living rooms are being taken over by 72-inch screens for better viewing even before they are furnished. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Newer, better models to enhance our viewing pleasure are being advertised every day."}, {"type": "example", "content": " We have been turned into voyeurs. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Since the first 5-inch black and white television sets arrived in the early 1940s, people have been fascinated by what's on it."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le17ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to furnish"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put furniture in a house or room"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Living rooms are being taken over by 72-inch screens for better viewing even before they are furnished. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear and use when talking about TV shows."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "voyeur"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bperson who \u200bwatches other people's \u200bprivate \u200blives"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have been turned into voyeurs. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to install"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put \u200bfurniture, a \u200bmachine, or a \u200bpiece of \u200bequipment into \u200bposition and make it \u200bready to use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Today more sets are being bought and installed then ever. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "headliner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the main performer in a show or concert"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: \u201cThe Golden Age of Television\" drew its headliners from Hollywood movies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quirky"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unusual in an \u200battractive and \u200binteresting way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The constantly happy household featured in the 50s and 60s has given way to more realistic or quirkier renditions of the same."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rendition"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bparticular way of \u200bperforming or displaying something in a similar way to what was done previously"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The household featured in the 50s and 60s has given way to more realist or quirkier renditions of the same. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le17ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk about shows that are no longer on, that you used to watch."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain why you enjoyed them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what you know about the actors who were in them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what happened on the show and what has happened to the actors since then"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask other people about their favorite old shows."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out what shows you have in common and whether they give the same reasons as you do."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about shows that are no longer on using used to and would."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain my reasons for liking the show."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the Present Perfect tense and the Simple Past tense."}]}]}